#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.101.0 — Procurement 5: Purchase Orders (pass 5 of 8).

The commitment document: anatomy, creation discipline, submission's
machinery (incoming pipeline + the received/billed ledger), status
worklists, Hold & Close with the phantom-incoming sweep, amendments
and sourcing integrity, and the supplier-promise craft (acknowledgment,
expediting, OTIF). Manual depth from birth: 9 chapters, 35-bank.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_procure_pro.seed_procure_pro_track

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.100.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

